      "created_at": "2011-08-28T17:58:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yep, Arenson, we were playing a pary of five.</p>\n<p>I thought it all seemed legal, the other players were mostly arguing “but how can you wrest the mind of a robot, or an explosive device for that matter?”</p>\n<p>Its an intersting fundamental question of gaming really… Game Mechanics versus story.</p>\n<p>Lodge from The Gamers: Dorkness Rising says “Story trumps rules!”</p>",
