      "id": 21988,
      "name": "Cervie77",
      "username": "Cervie77",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/ac8455/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-28T18:57:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You know, I actually did point out to my team that it says Omnitron is sentient, so must have a mind which Visionary can wrest from it. They didn’t buy it though.</p>\n<p>So I went on to say “Look, we’re all on the same team here, right? And our goal is to beat Omnitron, yes? Well then why in the biscuits are you blocking me on this?”</p>\n<p>They all looked at each other and shrugged. LOL!</p>\n<p>It turns out that they agreed with me on the mechanics of it all, just not the flavor.</p>",
