      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/e95f7d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-06T02:40:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We played a game like this too, except she kept redirecting all the damage at Omni himself. It was a win, but what a drag; she basically solo’ed Omni - she just needed us to be targets for the initial 15 damage. Boooooring!</p>\n<p>I came here to read how we were doing it wrong; thinking that something as broken and un-fun as that would have been found in playtesting and fixed. Sooo…no?</p>",
