      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/writerryan/{size}/2710_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-14T16:22:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Basically, yes. However, they recently changed Wrest the Mind (via errata) to make it only affect non-villians, which is to say it can only be played on minions and the like. This makes it a much more reasonable combination, although there are still very powerful options with it, such as using it on Electro-pulse Explosive.</p>",
